From 9ac4037b1abad76a8d42e40c3ca86a0dcaf16cd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iori Yanokura <ab.ioryz@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:51:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] hw/timer: Add Renesas RA Asynchronous General Purpose
 Timer (AGT)

A 16-bit down counter that reloads on underflow and raises the AGTI
event. Only timer mode is modelled; this is what the Arduino UNO R4 core
uses for millis(), with AGT0 underflowing every millisecond.
---
 hw/timer/Kconfig                  |   4 +
 hw/timer/meson.build              |   2 +
 hw/timer/renesas_ra_agt.c         | 254 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/hw/timer/renesas_ra_agt.h |  39 +++++
 4 files changed, 299 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 hw/timer/renesas_ra_agt.c
 create mode 100644 include/hw/timer/renesas_ra_agt.h

